WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.067 --> 00:00:09.320
Mom has big news.

2
00:00:09.321 --> 00:00:15.279
Do you want to hear about it?

3
00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:18.866
Dad: Mom has some news for you guys.

4
00:00:18.867 --> 00:00:22.260
Mom: Do you remember Aunt Sunny?

5
00:00:22.261 --> 00:00:26.800
Bada: Who is that?

6
00:00:26.801 --> 00:00:29.844
Hana: Oh, I remember her, Mom.

7
00:00:29.845 --> 00:00:32.137
She is your best friend.

8
00:00:32.138 --> 00:00:35.000
Hana: She came to Korea last year.

9
00:00:35.001 --> 00:00:38.473
Mom: That's right. But call her Aunt Sunny.

10
00:00:38.474 --> 00:00:40.774
Mom: She is like a sister to me.

11
00:00:40.775 --> 00:00:47.308
We were invited to her wedding!

12
00:00:47.309 --> 00:00:50.619
Hana: That means we are going to America?

13
00:00:50.620 --> 00:00:52.368
Mom: Except for Dad.

14
00:00:52.369 --> 00:00:56.914
He has to work.

15
00:00:56.915 --> 00:01:00.138
Hana: Sorry, Dad. But don't worry.

16
00:01:00.139 --> 00:01:04.986
Hana: I will take lots of pictures and bring them back to you.

17
00:01:04.987 --> 00:01:09.018
Dad: Thank you, dear.

18
00:01:09.019 --> 00:01:11.681
Bada: What about Hada, Mom?

19
00:01:11.682 --> 00:01:15.630
Mom: Grandma will take care of him.

20
00:01:15.631 --> 00:01:17.900
Hana: How long are we staying?

21
00:01:17.901 --> 00:01:23.383
Mom: We will stay for about a month.

22
00:01:23.384 --> 00:01:26.935
Yes, a trip to America!

23
00:01:26.936 --> 00:01:29.792
I will tell you all about it.

24
00:01:29.793 --> 00:01:32.755
Wait and see!
